Article 2 (Budget) The Administrator of the Rural Development Administration and the Minister of the Korea Forest Service (hereinafter referred to as the "heads of agencies") shall report the following matters to the Minister of Agriculture, Food and Rural Affairs (hereinafter referred to as the "Minister") in advance before submitting them to relevant institutions. The same shall apply when intending to change any matter already reported: <Amended on March 23, 2013>
1. Budget requests (including supplementary budget requests);
2. Requests for the use of reserve funds.
